{
    "lesson": 7,
    "title": [
        "Let's Go Shopping for Clothes!",
        "我们去买衣服吧！"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Vivien and Olivia are good friends and they usually go shopping together.",
                "薇薇安和奥利维亚是好朋友，她们通常一起去购物。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Hi! This is Viv.",
                "「嗨！我是薇薇。"
            ],
            [
                "Have you read the advertisement for the Central Shopping Centre?",
                "你看到中央购物中心的广告了吗？"
            ],
            [
                "There are many clothes on sale.",
                "有很多衣服在打折。"
            ],
            [
                "I need a new jacket or a new coat, as well as a new pair of boots.",
                "我需要一件新夹克或新外套，还有一双新靴子。"
            ],
            [
                "Would you like to come?\" asked Vivien on the phone.",
                "你想来吗？」薇薇安在电话里问道。"
            ],
            [
                "\"I've read that!",
                "「我看到了！"
            ],
            [
                "There are so many discounts.",
                "有这么多折扣。"
            ],
            [
                "I also want to buy new clothes, maybe a nice T-shirt or a blouse.",
                "我也想买新衣服，也许是一件漂亮的T恤或女式衬衫。"
            ],
            [
                "By the way, the jumper I bought last time doesn't fit me well, so I need to change the size.",
                "顺便说一下，我上次买的针织衫不太合身，所以我需要换个尺码。"
            ],
            [
                "Let's meet around three,\" answered Olivia.",
                "我们三点左右见面吧，」奥利维亚回答。"
            ],
            [
                "They met at the entrance of the shopping center.",
                "他们在购物中心入口处见面。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Look at the poster over there!",
                "「看那边的海报！"
            ],
            [
                "The model in the striped shirt and slim trousers looks great.",
                "那个穿着条纹衬衫和修身裤的模特看起来很棒。"
            ],
            [
                "We should go to that store and have a look,\" said Vivien with excitement.",
                "我们应该去那家店看看，」薇薇安兴奋地说。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Good afternoon! Is there anything I can help?\" A shop assistant gave Vivien and Olivia a polite greeting when they walked in.",
                "「下午好！有什么我可以帮助的吗？」一位店员在她们走进店时礼貌地向薇薇安和奥利维亚打招呼。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Yes. I'd like to try on what the model wears on that poster.\" Vivien requested while looking around the shop.",
                "「是的。我想试穿那张海报上模特穿的衣服。」薇薇安一边环顾店铺一边要求。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Certainly. If you're interested, I also recommend you try on this A-line skirt with black and white stripes and that pair of shorts.",
                "「当然。如果您感兴趣，我还推荐您试穿这条黑白条纹的A字裙和那条短裤。"
            ],
            [
                "They both match perfectly with that shirt.\" The shop assistant suggested with a smile.",
                "它们和那件衬衫都很配。」店员微笑着建议。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Why not?\" Vivien tried them on and decided to take them all.",
                "「为什么不呢？」薇薇安试穿了它们并决定全部买下。"
            ],
            [
                "\"500 pounds? It's a bit expensive, isn't it?\" Olivia whispered to Vivien when she checked out.",
                "「500英镑？有点贵，不是吗？」奥利维亚在结账时低声对薇薇安说。"
            ],
            [
                "\"They're all half-price!\" Vivien said, \"I need the clothes and I want to spend my money on them.\"",
                "「它们都是半价！」薇薇安说，「我需要这些衣服，我想把钱花在它们上面。」"
            ]
        ]
    },
